          "content": {
            "size": 6313,
            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "text": "/* Orbitron is requested via the shared Google Fonts <link> in index.html (it is\n   used here and in the Stella tab); a CSS @import here would be a serial,\n   render-blocking second request. */\n#mainTabs {\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane {\n  padding-top: 1rem;\n}\n\n.fm-shell {\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(245, 200, 126, 0.18), transparent 28%),\n    radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(66, 153, 225, 0.16), transparent 30%),\n    linear-gradient(180deg, var(--content-bg) 0%, var(--content-bg-alt) 100%);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: 26px;\n  box-shadow: 0 26px 60px var(--shadow-color);\n}\n\n.fm-hero {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem 1.1rem;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.fm-hero-copy {\n  max-width: 760px;\n}\n\n.fm-eyebrow {\n  margin-bottom: 0.45rem;\n  color: var(--accent-warning);\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.fm-title {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.fm-lead {\n  margin: 0.75rem 0 0;\n  color: var(--content-text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.98rem;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.fm-view-switcher {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.45rem;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n}\n\n.fm-view-btn {\n  min-width: 118px;\n  padding: 0.6rem 0.95rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  transition:\n    background 0.16s ease,\n    color 0.16s ease,\n    border-color 0.16s ease,\n    box-shadow 0.16s ease;\n}\n\n.fm-view-btn:hover {\n  background: var(--content-bg);\n  border-color: var(--border-strong);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 20px var(--shadow-color);\n}\n\n.fm-view-btn.active {\n  color: #fff;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-primary) 0%, var(--accent-primary-hover) 100%);\n  border-color: transparent;\n  box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(74, 124, 89, 0.25);\n}\n\n.fm-info-strip {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.4rem;\n  padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  color: var(--content-text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.fm-info-divider {\n  color: var(--content-text-muted);\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n.fm-body {\n  padding: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.fm-view {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.fm-view.active {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.fm-panel-intro {\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n\n.fm-panel-intro h4 {\n  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n\n.fm-panel-intro p {\n  color: var(--content-text-muted);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .card {\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 14px 28px var(--shadow-color);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .card-header {\n  border-bottom: 0;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .card-body {\n  padding: 1.1rem 1.15rem 1.2rem;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .mb-3 {\n  margin-bottom: 0.8rem !important;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .form-label {\n  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n\n.fm-submit-btn {\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding-block: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.fm-results-card {\n  min-height: 100%;\n}\n\n.fm-results-hint {\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n}\n\n.fm-empty-state {\n  padding: 1.3rem 0.3rem;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.fm-empty-state h5 {\n  margin-bottom: 0.45rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .alert {\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .result-item {\n  margin: 0.5rem 0;\n  padding: 0.9rem 0.95rem;\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-success);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .result-value {\n  color: var(--accent-success);\n  font-size: 1.28rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .pass-checkbox {\n  height: 100%;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0.8rem;\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(218, 184, 106, 0.45);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition:\n    transform 0.14s ease,\n    box-shadow 0.14s ease,\n    border-color 0.14s ease;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .pass-checkbox:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 22px var(--shadow-color);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .pass-checkbox * {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .premium-pass {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(140, 104, 209, 0.08) 0%, var(--content-bg) 100%);\n  border-color: rgba(140, 104, 209, 0.38);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .elite-pass {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.08) 0%, var(--content-bg) 100%);\n  border-color: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.34);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .data-table-container {\n  max-height: 70vh;\n  overflow: auto;\n  background: var(--content-bg);\n  border-radius: 0 0 18px 18px;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .data-table {\n  font-size: 0.84rem;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .data-table th {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 10;\n  color: #fff;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  background: var(--accent-primary);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .data-table td {\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  border-right: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .furthest-barrier-row {\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .furthest-barrier-row::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: -1px;\n  left: 0;\n  height: 3px;\n  background: var(--accent-success);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .breakpoint-line {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 30px;\n  margin: 8px 0;\n  padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;\n  color: #fff;\n  font-size: 0.74rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-align: center;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .breakpoint-line.free-user {\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #28a745, #20c997);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .breakpoint-line.premium-user {\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #17a2b8, #6f42c1);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane .breakpoint-line.elite-user {\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffc107, #fd7e14);\n}\n\n.fm-calculator-pane #fcChartContainer {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 230px;\n  margin: 12px 0;\n  padding: 8px;\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n}\n"
          },
