            "text": "/* Stella's Lucky Elevator — bomb-decision, result, and rewards styles.\n   Continues the .stella-* namespace and CSS variables from stella-elevator.css. */\n\n/* ---------- Bomb decision options ---------- */\n\n.stella-bomb-summary {\n  margin: 0.6rem 0 0.8rem;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  color: var(--stella-subheading);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-banner {\n  margin: 0.4rem 0 0.6rem;\n  padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--stella-border);\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n  color: var(--stella-subheading);\n  background: var(--stella-neutral-bg);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-banner-info {\n  background: var(--stella-info-bg);\n  border-color: var(--stella-info-border);\n  color: var(--stella-info-text);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-banner-state.stella-bomb-banner-good,\n.stella-bomb-banner-state.stella-bomb-banner-mild-good {\n  background: var(--stella-success-bg);\n  border-color: var(--stella-success-border);\n  color: var(--stella-success-text);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-banner-state.stella-bomb-banner-bad,\n.stella-bomb-banner-state.stella-bomb-banner-mild-bad {\n  background: var(--stella-danger-bg);\n  border-color: var(--stella-danger-border);\n  color: var(--stella-danger-text);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-banner-state.stella-bomb-banner-neutral {\n  background: var(--stella-neutral-bg);\n  border-color: var(--stella-neutral-border);\n  color: var(--stella-neutral-text);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-median {\n  margin-top: 0.3rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--stella-text-muted);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-options {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));\n  gap: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-option {\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n  background: var(--stella-surface-raised);\n  border: 1px solid var(--stella-border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-option-best {\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    180deg,\n    var(--stella-success-bg) 0%,\n    var(--stella-surface-raised) 70%\n  );\n  border-color: var(--stella-success-border);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(47, 158, 68, 0.1);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-option-disabled {\n  opacity: 0.55;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-option-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-option-name {\n  color: var(--stella-heading);\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-option-best-tag {\n  padding: 0.15rem 0.55rem;\n  background: #d3edd7;\n  color: #1e5031;\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-detail {\n  color: var(--stella-soft-text);\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-prob {\n  margin-top: 0.5rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 0.45rem;\n  color: var(--stella-text);\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-prob-sub {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  color: var(--stella-text-muted);\n  letter-spacing: 0;\n}\n\n.stella-result-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n.stella-result-box {\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n  background: var(--stella-result-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--stella-result-border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n}\n\n.stella-result-label {\n  color: var(--stella-result-label);\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.09em;\n}\n\n.stella-result-value {\n  margin-top: 0.15rem;\n  color: var(--stella-text);\n  font-family: 'Orbitron', monospace;\n  font-size: 1.55rem;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.stella-result-sub {\n  margin-top: 0.25rem;\n  color: var(--stella-text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.stella-result-floors {\n  color: var(--stella-soft-text);\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  word-break: break-word;\n}\n\n.stella-result-note {\n  color: var(--stella-text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n}\n\n/* ---------- Rewards ---------- */\n\n.stella-rewards-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 320px), 1fr));\n  gap: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n.stella-tier {\n  padding: 0.75rem 0.9rem 0.9rem;\n  background: var(--stella-surface-raised);\n  border: 1px solid var(--stella-border);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  box-shadow: 0 3px 10px var(--stella-shadow-soft);\n}\n\n.stella-tier-safe {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--stella-safe-bg) 0%, var(--stella-surface-raised) 70%);\n  border-color: var(--stella-safe-border);\n}\n\n.stella-tier-risk {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--stella-risk-bg) 0%, var(--stella-surface-raised) 70%);\n  border-color: var(--stella-risk-border);\n}\n\n.stella-tier-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.55rem;\n}\n\n.stella-tier-label {\n  color: var(--stella-heading);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.stella-tier-badge {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.stella-safe-list {\n  padding-left: 1.1rem;\n  color: var(--stella-safe-text);\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n}\n\n.stella-risk-table {\n  --bs-border-color: var(--stella-border);\n  --bs-table-bg: transparent;\n  --bs-table-color: var(--stella-text);\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n}\n\n.stella-risk-table thead th {\n  background: var(--stella-risk-head-bg);\n  color: var(--stella-risk-text);\n  font-size: 0.76rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n.stella-set-letter {\n  width: 34px;\n  color: var(--stella-risk-text);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  text-align: center;\n  background: var(--stella-set-bg);\n}\n\n.stella-bomb-cell {\n  color: var(--stella-bomb-text);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: var(--stella-bomb-bg);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .stella-calc-form {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n  .stella-title {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n  .stella-result-value {\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n}\n"
          },
