          "content": {
            "size": 4636,
            "mimeType": "text/css",
            "text": "/* Beginner Guide — blog-style layout */\n\n.guide-container {\n  max-width: 820px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 1.5rem 1rem 3rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n\n.guide-attribution {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--content-text-muted);\n}\n.guide-attribution strong {\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n\n.guide-vintage-notice {\n  background: rgba(245, 215, 122, 0.18);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold-light);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--accent-gold);\n}\n\n/* Table of Contents */\n.guide-toc {\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n}\n.guide-toc h3 {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n.guide-toc ol {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding-left: 1.25rem;\n}\n.guide-toc li {\n  margin-bottom: 0.2rem;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n.guide-toc a {\n  color: var(--accent-info);\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n.guide-toc a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n\n/* Sections */\n.guide-section {\n  margin-bottom: 2.5rem;\n}\n.guide-section h2 {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-gold-light);\n  padding-left: 0.75rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n.guide-section h3 {\n  font-size: 1.15rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n.guide-section p {\n  margin-bottom: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n/* Tip cards */\n.guide-tip-card {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.85rem;\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1rem;\n}\n.guide-tip-number {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--accent-primary);\n  color: #fff;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n.guide-tip-card h4 {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin: 0 0 0.4rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n.guide-tip-card p {\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n.guide-tip-card p:last-child {\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n\n/* Images */\n.guide-img-wrap {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin: 0.75rem 0 1rem;\n}\n.guide-img {\n  max-width: 400px;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px var(--shadow-color);\n}\n.guide-img-caption {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--content-text-muted);\n  margin-top: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n/* Strategy cards (mid game) */\n.guide-strategy-card {\n  background: var(--content-bg-alt);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  height: 100%;\n}\n.guide-strategy-card h4 {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n  color: var(--content-text);\n}\n.guide-strategy-card p {\n  font-size: 0.93rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n}\n.guide-strategy-card p:last-child {\n  margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n.guide-strategy-card .guide-manager-list {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--content-text-muted);\n  padding-left: 1rem;\n  margin: 0.4rem 0 0;\n}\n\n/* Callout boxes */\n.guide-callout {\n  background: var(--accent-primary-light);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-primary);\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n  margin: 1rem 0;\n  font-size: 0.93rem;\n}\n\n/* Cross-links to other tabs */\n.guide-cross-link {\n  color: var(--accent-primary);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(74, 124, 89, 0.3);\n  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n}\n.guide-cross-link:hover {\n  border-bottom-color: var(--accent-primary);\n  color: var(--accent-primary-hover);\n}\n\n/* Research priority colors */\n.guide-priority-red {\n  color: var(--el-flame);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.guide-priority-green {\n  color: var(--el-nature);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n.guide-priority-blue {\n  color: var(--accent-info);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* Responsive */\n@media (max-width: 767.98px) {\n  .guide-container {\n    padding: 1rem 0.75rem 2rem;\n  }\n  .guide-section h2 {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n  }\n  .guide-section h3 {\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n  }\n  .guide-tip-card {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  .guide-tip-number {\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n  }\n  .guide-img {\n    max-width: 320px;\n  }\n}\n@media (max-width: 575.98px) {\n  .guide-container {\n    padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .guide-section h2 {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n  }\n  .guide-vintage-notice {\n    font-size: 0.82rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;\n  }\n}\n"
          },
