          "cookies": [],
          "content": {
            "size": 12149,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"essenceplanner\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"essence-tab\">\n  <div class=\"row mt-3\">\n    <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-5 mb-3\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"card-body\">\n          <h6 class=\"card-title mb-3\">Essence Planner</h6>\n\n          <div class=\"mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"d-flex align-items-end gap-2 mb-1\">\n              <div class=\"flex-grow-1\">\n                <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Super Manager</label>\n                <select class=\"form-select form-select-sm\" id=\"essenceSmSelect\">\n                  <option value=\"\">-- Select SM --</option>\n                </select>\n              </div>\n              <div style=\"min-width: 140px\">\n                <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\"\n                  >Filter\n                  <span\n                    id=\"essenceFilterHelp\"\n                    style=\"cursor: pointer; color: var(--content-text-muted); position: relative\"\n                    >&#9432;\n                    <div\n                      id=\"essenceFilterTooltip\"\n                      style=\"\n                        display: none;\n                        position: absolute;\n                        bottom: calc(100% + 6px);\n                        right: 0;\n                        background: #222;\n                        color: #eee;\n                        padding: 8px 10px;\n                        border-radius: 6px;\n                        font-size: 0.75rem;\n                        line-height: 1.4;\n                        white-space: normal;\n                        width: 220px;\n                        z-index: 1000;\n                        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n                      \"\n                    >\n                      <b>Rankable</b> — Unlocked SMs below Rank 5<br /><b>Affordable</b> — Any\n                      non-common SM you can rank up at least once with current essence,<br />\n                      including locked R0 SMs; rare SMs use only elemental essence<br /><b\n                        >All unlocked</b\n                      >\n                      — Every unlocked SM not at max rank<br /><b>Can get CIF/MIF</b> — Only SMs\n                      where income passives are reachable<br /><b>Can get MSUCR</b> — Only SMs where\n                      cost reduction is reachable\n                    </div></span\n                  ></label\n                >\n                <select class=\"form-select form-select-sm\" id=\"essenceSmFilter\">\n                  <option value=\"rankable\">Rankable</option>\n                  <option value=\"affordable\">Affordable</option>\n                  <option value=\"all\">All unlocked</option>\n                  <option value=\"cif_mif\">Can get CIF/MIF</option>\n                  <option value=\"msucr\">Can get MSUCR</option>\n                </select>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-2 mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"col-4\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Current Rank</label>\n              <select class=\"form-select form-select-sm\" id=\"essenceCurrentRank\">\n                <option value=\"0\">R0</option>\n                <option value=\"1\">R1</option>\n                <option value=\"2\">R2</option>\n                <option value=\"3\">R3</option>\n                <option value=\"4\">R4</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-4\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Fragments</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceCurrentFrags\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                max=\"500\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-4\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Target Rank</label>\n              <select class=\"form-select form-select-sm\" id=\"essenceTargetRank\">\n                <option value=\"1\">R1</option>\n                <option value=\"2\">R2</option>\n                <option value=\"3\">R3</option>\n                <option value=\"4\">R4</option>\n                <option value=\"5\" selected>R5</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <hr class=\"my-2\" />\n          <h6 class=\"card-title mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">Essence Inventory</h6>\n          <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 0.75rem\">\n            Enter your current on-hand essence to see surplus/deficit.\n          </p>\n\n          <div class=\"row g-2 mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Nature</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvNature\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Frost</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvFrost\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Flame</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvFlame\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Light</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvLight\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Dark</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvDark\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Wind</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvWind\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Sand</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvSand\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Water</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvWater\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Epic</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvEpic\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Legendary</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvLegendary\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Chaos</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvChaos\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-3\">\n              <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Order</label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                id=\"essenceInvOrder\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                value=\"0\"\n              />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <hr class=\"my-2\" />\n          <div class=\"form-check mb-2\">\n            <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"essencePouchToggle\" />\n            <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"essencePouchToggle\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\"\n              >Include pouch simulation\n              <span\n                id=\"essencePouchHelp\"\n                style=\"cursor: pointer; color: var(--content-text-muted); position: relative\"\n                >&#9432;\n                <div\n                  id=\"essencePouchTooltip\"\n                  style=\"\n                    display: none;\n                    position: absolute;\n                    bottom: calc(100% + 6px);\n                    left: 0;\n                    background: #222;\n                    color: #eee;\n                    padding: 8px 10px;\n                    border-radius: 6px;\n                    font-size: 0.75rem;\n                    line-height: 1.4;\n                    white-space: normal;\n                    width: 240px;\n                    z-index: 1000;\n                    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n                  \"\n                >\n                  <b>Not a random roll simulation.</b> Adds the mathematical <b>average drop</b> per\n                  pouch to your inventory. Only meaningful with many pouches (50+) where luck\n                  averages out — with just a few, your real drops will vary wildly from this.\n                </div></span\n              ></label\n            >\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"essencePouchInputs\" style=\"display: none\">\n            <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 0.72rem\">\n              Enter pouch counts to add expected average essence drops to your inventory.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"row g-2 mb-2\">\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Pouches</label>\n                <input\n                  type=\"number\"\n                  class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                  id=\"essencePouchRegular\"\n                  min=\"0\"\n                  value=\"0\"\n                />\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Big Pouches</label>\n                <input\n                  type=\"number\"\n                  class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                  id=\"essencePouchBig\"\n                  min=\"0\"\n                  value=\"0\"\n                />\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"col-4\">\n                <label class=\"form-label form-label-sm mb-1\">Giant Pouches</label>\n                <input\n                  type=\"number\"\n                  class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n                  id=\"essencePouchGiant\"\n                  min=\"0\"\n                  value=\"0\"\n                />\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-info w-100\" id=\"essenceOpenPouchesBtn\">\n              Open Pouches\n            </button>\n            <div\n              id=\"essencePouchSummary\"\n              class=\"text-muted mt-1\"\n              style=\"display: none; font-size: 0.72rem; line-height: 1.4\"\n            ></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-lg-8 col-md-7\">\n      <div id=\"essenceResults\">\n        <div class=\"text-muted text-center py-5\" style=\"font-size: 0.9rem\">\n          Select a Super Manager and target rank to see the essence breakdown.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
          },
