            "text": "<!-- Everdeep Tab -->\n<div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"everdeep\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"everdeep-tab\">\n  <div class=\"everdeep-pane\">\n    <div class=\"everdeep-header\">\n      <h2>Everdeep Mines</h2>\n      <div class=\"everdeep-meta\" id=\"everdeepMeta\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"everdeep-intro\">\n      Elevator, warehouse and mineshaft elements for every mine of the current Everdeep event. Tap a\n      biome heading to roll it open or closed — the early no-element mines start collapsed.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"everdeep-controls\" id=\"everdeepControls\"></div>\n    <div id=\"everdeepContainer\" class=\"everdeep-loading\">Loading Everdeep data…</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
