          "content": {
            "size": 5129,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<!-- Stella Elevator Tab -->\n<div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"stellaelevator\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"stella-tab\">\n  <div class=\"stella-shell\">\n    <div class=\"stella-hero\">\n      <div class=\"stella-eyebrow\">Event reference</div>\n      <h2 class=\"stella-title\">Stella's Lucky Elevator</h2>\n      <p class=\"stella-lead\">\n        50-floor push-your-luck event. Safe checkpoints every 5 floors, 25% bomb on every risk\n        floor. Full reward pools below, plus a ticket calculator for any target floor.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"stella-card\" aria-labelledby=\"stellaMechanicsTitle\">\n      <h3 class=\"stella-card-title\" id=\"stellaMechanicsTitle\">How it works</h3>\n      <div id=\"stellaMechanicsBody\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"stella-card\" aria-labelledby=\"stellaCalcTitle\">\n      <h3 class=\"stella-card-title\" id=\"stellaCalcTitle\">\n        Ticket calculator — one run with revives\n      </h3>\n      <form id=\"stellaCalcForm\" class=\"stella-calc-form\" novalidate>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"stellaCalcTarget\">Target floor</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"form-control\"\n            id=\"stellaCalcTarget\"\n            min=\"1\"\n            max=\"50\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            value=\"50\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"stellaCalcBudget\">Ticket budget</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"form-control\"\n            id=\"stellaCalcBudget\"\n            min=\"0\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            value=\"100\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stella-calc-express-wrap\">\n          <label class=\"form-check form-check-inline mb-0\">\n            <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"stellaCalcExpress\" />\n            Use Express Ticket (start at floor 20)\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n      <div id=\"stellaCalcResult\" class=\"stella-result\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"stella-card\" aria-labelledby=\"stellaBombTitle\">\n      <h3 class=\"stella-card-title\" id=\"stellaBombTitle\">\n        Mid-run calculator — keep going or restart?\n      </h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 0.88rem\">\n        Use this any time during a Stella run to evaluate your odds. Toggle \"Just bombed\" if you\n        need to factor in the clear cost; otherwise it assumes you're between bombs and just\n        deciding whether to keep climbing. On risk floors, \"Current floor\" means the floor currently\n        in front of you, so its bomb risk is still included.\n      </p>\n      <form id=\"stellaBombForm\" class=\"stella-calc-form\" novalidate>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"stellaBombFloor\">Current floor</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"form-control\"\n            id=\"stellaBombFloor\"\n            min=\"1\"\n            max=\"49\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            value=\"31\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"stellaBombRevives\">Revives used so far</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"form-control\"\n            id=\"stellaBombRevives\"\n            min=\"0\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            value=\"5\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"stellaBombElevator\">Elevator tickets remaining</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"form-control\"\n            id=\"stellaBombElevator\"\n            min=\"0\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            value=\"31\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"stellaBombExpress\">Express tickets remaining</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"form-control\"\n            id=\"stellaBombExpress\"\n            min=\"0\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            value=\"2\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <label class=\"form-label\" for=\"stellaBombTarget\">Target floor</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"number\"\n            class=\"form-control\"\n            id=\"stellaBombTarget\"\n            min=\"1\"\n            max=\"50\"\n            step=\"1\"\n            value=\"50\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stella-calc-express-wrap\">\n          <label class=\"form-check form-check-inline mb-0\">\n            <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"stellaBombHasBomb\" checked />\n            Just bombed (need to clear)\n          </label>\n        </div>\n      </form>\n      <div id=\"stellaBombResult\" class=\"stella-result\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"stella-card\" aria-labelledby=\"stellaRewardsTitle\">\n      <h3 class=\"stella-card-title\" id=\"stellaRewardsTitle\">Rewards by floor</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-muted mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 0.88rem\">\n        Risk floors roll one set randomly from their pool each time you step onto them. Safe floors\n        always show the same four rewards (pick 1 of 4, no bomb).\n      </p>\n      <div id=\"stellaRewardsRoot\" class=\"stella-rewards-grid\"></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
          },
          "redirectURL": "",
          "headersSize": -1,
          "bodySize": -1,
