          "content": {
            "size": 9109,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"smcomparison\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"sm-comparison-tab\">\n  <div class=\"sm-comp-wrap\">\n    <nav class=\"sm-comp-mode-pills\" id=\"smCompModePills\" aria-label=\"SM comparison mode\"></nav>\n    <div class=\"sm-comp-mode-help text-muted\" id=\"smCompModeHelp\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\"></div>\n    <div class=\"sm-comp-intro\" id=\"smCompIntroDefault\">\n      <h5 class=\"mb-1\">\n        Mineshaft actives per second\n        <span\n          class=\"badge bg-warning text-dark ms-2\"\n          style=\"font-size: 0.65rem; vertical-align: middle\"\n          >ALPHA</span\n        >\n      </h5>\n      <div class=\"alert alert-warning py-2 px-3 mb-2\" style=\"font-size: 0.82rem\" role=\"alert\">\n        <strong>This tab is in ALPHA.</strong> Expect bugs - some intervals and mechanics are may be\n        off. If something looks wrong, please message <strong>@coldeer</strong> on the\n        <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/idleminertycoon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\n          >official IMT Discord</a\n        >\n        so it can be fixed.\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">\n        Compares cash-per-second output from Mineshaft Super Managers whose active grants cash on a\n        fixed tick (either instant cash, or to-warehouse cash). Values pull from your SM Tracker\n        state (level &amp; rank). Only unlocked SMs are shown. Pick a\n        <strong>Mineshaft element</strong> to scale each SM by its effectiveness (SE &times;1.5, PE\n        &times;0.6, NVE &times;0.2); Elevator and Warehouse elements further scale Sir Axiom &amp;\n        Vulcan's own boost by their effectiveness. Set <strong>Zoe</strong> &amp;\n        <strong>Cervina</strong> shaft counts directly in their rows; Cervina caps at &times;100.\n        Rows marked <strong>~Xs*</strong> use your <strong>Shaft cycle</strong> value &mdash;\n        override it to reflect your mineshaft worker speed.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sm-comp-controls\" id=\"smCompControlsDefault\">\n      <div\n        class=\"sm-comp-elements d-flex align-items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\"\n        style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\"\n      >\n        <span class=\"text-muted\">Element:</span>\n        <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-1\">\n          Mineshaft\n          <select\n            class=\"form-select form-select-sm\"\n            id=\"smCompElement\"\n            aria-label=\"Mineshaft element for scaling\"\n          >\n            <option value=\"\">&mdash;</option>\n            <option value=\"flame\">Flame</option>\n            <option value=\"frost\">Frost</option>\n            <option value=\"nature\">Nature</option>\n            <option value=\"wind\">Wind</option>\n            <option value=\"water\">Water</option>\n            <option value=\"dark\">Dark</option>\n            <option value=\"light\">Light</option>\n            <option value=\"sand\">Sand</option>\n            <option value=\"order\">Order</option>\n            <option value=\"chaos\">Chaos</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-1\">\n          Elevator\n          <select\n            class=\"form-select form-select-sm\"\n            id=\"smCompElevatorElement\"\n            aria-label=\"Elevator element (scales Sir Axiom)\"\n          >\n            <option value=\"\">&mdash;</option>\n            <option value=\"flame\">Flame</option>\n            <option value=\"frost\">Frost</option>\n            <option value=\"nature\">Nature</option>\n            <option value=\"wind\">Wind</option>\n            <option value=\"water\">Water</option>\n            <option value=\"dark\">Dark</option>\n            <option value=\"light\">Light</option>\n            <option value=\"sand\">Sand</option>\n            <option value=\"order\">Order</option>\n            <option value=\"chaos\">Chaos</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-1\">\n          Warehouse\n          <select\n            class=\"form-select form-select-sm\"\n            id=\"smCompWarehouseElement\"\n            aria-label=\"Warehouse element (scales Vulcan)\"\n          >\n            <option value=\"\">&mdash;</option>\n            <option value=\"flame\">Flame</option>\n            <option value=\"frost\">Frost</option>\n            <option value=\"nature\">Nature</option>\n            <option value=\"wind\">Wind</option>\n            <option value=\"water\">Water</option>\n            <option value=\"dark\">Dark</option>\n            <option value=\"light\">Light</option>\n            <option value=\"sand\">Sand</option>\n            <option value=\"order\">Order</option>\n            <option value=\"chaos\">Chaos</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">\n        Shaft cycle:\n        <input\n          type=\"number\"\n          class=\"form-control form-control-sm\"\n          id=\"smCompShaftCycle\"\n          min=\"1\"\n          max=\"10\"\n          step=\"0.01\"\n          style=\"width: 5.5rem\"\n          aria-label=\"Shaft cycle seconds for worker-dependent SMs\"\n        />\n        <span\n          class=\"text-muted sm-comp-hint\"\n          data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\"\n          data-bs-placement=\"top\"\n          title=\"Interval (in seconds) for worker-dependent SMs: Zoe, Cervina, H4V0C, Green Idler, Dr Steiner, Ut'ux, Chef Bearnard. Depends on mineshaft level &mdash; early testing shows ~6&ndash;8s. Adjust to reflect shaft worker speed bonuses in your mine.\"\n        >\n          s (ⓘ)\n        </span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">\n        Rate:\n        <select\n          class=\"form-select form-select-sm\"\n          id=\"smCompRateMode\"\n          aria-label=\"Rate display mode\"\n        >\n          <option value=\"perSec\">Per second</option>\n          <option value=\"perActivation\">Per activation</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2 sm-comp-boost\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">\n        <input\n          type=\"checkbox\"\n          class=\"form-check-input\"\n          id=\"smCompBoostersOn\"\n          aria-label=\"Apply Sir Axiom and Vulcan active boosters\"\n        />\n        Apply Sir Axiom &amp; Vulcan\n        <span class=\"sm-comp-boost-summary\" id=\"smCompBoostersSummary\"></span>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"dropdown sm-comp-add-maxed-wrap\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">\n        <button\n          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary dropdown-toggle\"\n          type=\"button\"\n          id=\"smCompAddMaxedPicker\"\n          data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\"\n          aria-expanded=\"false\"\n        >\n          + Add maxed copy of&hellip;\n        </button>\n        <ul\n          class=\"dropdown-menu sm-comp-add-maxed-menu\"\n          id=\"smCompAddMaxedMenu\"\n          aria-labelledby=\"smCompAddMaxedPicker\"\n        ></ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sm-comp-controls\" id=\"smCompControlsMode\" hidden>\n      <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-1\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">\n        Element:\n        <select\n          class=\"form-select form-select-sm\"\n          id=\"smCompModeElement\"\n          aria-label=\"Element for current mode\"\n        >\n          <option value=\"\">—</option>\n          <option value=\"flame\">Flame</option>\n          <option value=\"frost\">Frost</option>\n          <option value=\"nature\">Nature</option>\n          <option value=\"wind\">Wind</option>\n          <option value=\"water\">Water</option>\n          <option value=\"dark\">Dark</option>\n          <option value=\"light\">Light</option>\n          <option value=\"sand\">Sand</option>\n          <option value=\"order\">Order</option>\n          <option value=\"chaos\">Chaos</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"d-flex align-items-center gap-2\" style=\"font-size: 0.85rem\">\n        Rate:\n        <select\n          class=\"form-select form-select-sm\"\n          id=\"smCompModeRateMode\"\n          aria-label=\"Rate display mode for current mode\"\n        >\n          <option value=\"perActivation\">Per activation (total)</option>\n          <option value=\"perSec\">Per second</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sm-comp-chart-wrap\">\n      <canvas id=\"smCompChart\" aria-label=\"Cash per second comparison chart\"></canvas>\n      <div id=\"smCompEmpty\" class=\"sm-comp-empty text-muted\" style=\"display: none\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sm-comp-table-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"table table-sm sm-comp-table\" id=\"smCompTable\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th>SM</th>\n            <th class=\"text-end\">Lv / Rank</th>\n            <th class=\"text-end\">Active</th>\n            <th class=\"text-center sm-comp-col-eff\">Eff.</th>\n            <th class=\"text-end\">Adj.</th>\n            <th class=\"text-end\">Interval</th>\n            <th class=\"text-end\">Duration</th>\n            <th class=\"text-end\" id=\"smCompRateHeader\">Per second</th>\n            <th class=\"text-center\">Include</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody id=\"smCompTableBody\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"smCompBestPerElement\" class=\"sm-comp-best-per-element\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
          },
