          "content": {
            "size": 14128,
            "mimeType": "text/html",
            "text": "<div class=\"tab-pane fade\" id=\"fmcalculator\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"fm-tab\">\n  <div class=\"fm-calculator-pane\">\n    <div class=\"fm-shell\">\n      <div class=\"fm-hero\">\n        <div class=\"fm-hero-copy\">\n          <div class=\"fm-eyebrow\">Frontier Mine</div>\n          <h2 class=\"fm-title\">Plan your skips without leaving the hub</h2>\n          <p class=\"fm-lead\">\n            Enter your current barrier and FC balance to see the furthest push, the cheapest\n            wait-then-rush route, and the full barrier-by-barrier progression.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"fm-view-switcher\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"FM views\">\n          <button\n            class=\"fm-view-btn active\"\n            type=\"button\"\n            id=\"fmViewCalculator\"\n            data-fm-view-target=\"calculator\"\n            aria-selected=\"true\"\n          >\n            Calculator\n          </button>\n          <button\n            class=\"fm-view-btn\"\n            type=\"button\"\n            id=\"fmViewData\"\n            data-fm-view-target=\"data\"\n            aria-selected=\"false\"\n          >\n            Barrier Data\n          </button>\n          <button\n            class=\"fm-view-btn\"\n            type=\"button\"\n            id=\"fmViewMethodology\"\n            data-fm-view-target=\"methodology\"\n            aria-selected=\"false\"\n          >\n            How It Works\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"fm-info-strip\">\n        <strong>Assumptions:</strong> Headpiece equipped, both pendrives equipped, and Edgar offers\n        treated as a flat starting bonus.\n        <span class=\"fm-info-divider\">|</span>\n        Found incorrect data? Contact <strong>@coldeer</strong> on Discord.\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"fm-body\">\n        <div class=\"fm-view active\" id=\"fmPanelCalculator\" data-fm-view=\"calculator\">\n          <div class=\"row g-4\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-5\">\n              <div class=\"card fm-input-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header bg-primary text-white\">\n                  <h4 class=\"mb-0\">Input Parameters</h4>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\n                  <form id=\"calcForm\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                      <label class=\"form-label\">Current FM Barrier</label>\n                      <select class=\"form-select\" id=\"barrier\" required>\n                        <option value=\"\">Loading barriers...</option>\n                      </select>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                      <label class=\"form-label\">Current FC Cash</label>\n                      <input\n                        type=\"number\"\n                        class=\"form-control\"\n                        id=\"fcCash\"\n                        placeholder=\"705\"\n                        value=\"705\"\n                        min=\"0\"\n                        max=\"50000\"\n                        required\n                      />\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                      <label class=\"form-label fw-bold\">Pass Selection</label>\n                      <div class=\"row g-2\">\n                        <div class=\"col-6\">\n                          <div class=\"pass-checkbox premium-pass h-100\">\n                            <div class=\"form-check\">\n                              <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"premiumPass\" />\n                              <label class=\"form-check-label fw-bold text-primary\">\n                                Premium Pass\n                                <br /><small class=\"text-muted\">Adds premium FC rewards</small>\n                              </label>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-6\">\n                          <div class=\"pass-checkbox elite-pass h-100\">\n                            <div class=\"form-check\">\n                              <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"elitePass\" />\n                              <label class=\"form-check-label fw-bold text-warning\">\n                                Elite Frontier Pass\n                                <br /><small class=\"text-muted\">Adds elite FC rewards</small>\n                              </label>\n                            </div>\n                          </div>\n                        </div>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                      <label class=\"form-label fw-bold\">\n                        Edgar FC Offers\n                        <span\n                          class=\"text-info\"\n                          data-bs-toggle=\"tooltip\"\n                          data-bs-placement=\"top\"\n                          title=\"Edgar offers FC up to 5 times per day when playing actively. Choose 0 if you do not want to assume any Edgar help.\"\n                        >\n                          Info\n                        </span>\n                      </label>\n                      <input\n                        type=\"number\"\n                        class=\"form-control\"\n                        id=\"edgarOffers\"\n                        value=\"1\"\n                        min=\"0\"\n                        max=\"100\"\n                        style=\"max-width: 120px\"\n                      />\n                      <small class=\"text-muted\">Each offer provides 35 FC.</small>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"mb-3\">\n                      <div class=\"form-check\">\n                        <input class=\"form-check-input\" type=\"checkbox\" id=\"useDefault\" checked />\n                        <label class=\"form-check-label\" for=\"useDefault\">\n                          <strong>Use the standard FC cost for the current barrier</strong>\n                          <br /><small class=\"text-muted\"\n                            >Uncheck this if your current barrier already costs less because time\n                            has passed.</small\n                          >\n                        </label>\n                      </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mb-3\" id=\"customFC\" style=\"display: none\">\n                      <label class=\"form-label\">\n                        <strong>Actual FC cost for your current barrier</strong>\n                        <br /><small class=\"text-muted\"\n                          >Enter the current skip cost shown in-game. Future barriers still use\n                          standard costs.</small\n                        >\n                      </label>\n                      <input\n                        type=\"number\"\n                        class=\"form-control\"\n                        id=\"customAmount\"\n                        value=\"100\"\n                        min=\"0\"\n                        max=\"50000\"\n                      />\n                    </div>\n\n                    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-success w-100 fm-submit-btn\">\n                      Calculate Skip Strategy\n                    </button>\n                  </form>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n              <div class=\"card fm-results-card\">\n                <div\n                  class=\"card-header bg-success text-white d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\"\n                >\n                  <h4 class=\"mb-0\">Results</h4>\n                  <span class=\"fm-results-hint\">Progression, rush timing, and FC balance</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-body\" id=\"results\">\n                  <div class=\"fm-empty-state\">\n                    <h5>Ready when you are</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">\n                      Run a calculation to see your furthest barrier, FC balance chart, wait-to-rush\n                      plan, and progression table.\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"fm-view\" id=\"fmPanelData\" data-fm-view=\"data\">\n          <div class=\"fm-panel-intro\">\n            <h4>Barrier Data</h4>\n            <p class=\"mb-0\">\n              Raw FM barrier values, FC rewards, and breakpoint lines for free, premium, and elite\n              paths.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"alert alert-info\">\n            <strong>Data updates:</strong> if a game update changes barrier values, message\n            <strong>@coldeer</strong> on Discord.\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"alert alert-success\">\n            <strong>Breakpoint analysis:</strong><br />\n            Lines between barriers show the first point where you can wait to accumulate FC, then\n            skip the rest.\n            <br /><small>Free user: 705 FC | Premium Pass: 1,205 FC | Elite Pass: 1,305 FC</small>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"card\">\n            <div\n              class=\"card-header bg-info text-white d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\"\n            >\n              <h4 class=\"mb-0\">Raw FM Data</h4>\n              <span id=\"dataStatus\" class=\"badge bg-light text-dark\">Loading...</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card-body p-0\">\n              <div class=\"data-table-container\">\n                <table class=\"table table-striped table-hover data-table mb-0\" id=\"dataTable\">\n                  <thead id=\"dataTableHead\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <th>Loading data...</th>\n                    </tr>\n                  </thead>\n                  <tbody id=\"dataTableBody\">\n                    <tr>\n                      <td>Please wait while data loads...</td>\n                    </tr>\n                  </tbody>\n                </table>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"fm-view\" id=\"fmPanelMethodology\" data-fm-view=\"methodology\">\n          <div class=\"fm-panel-intro\">\n            <h4>How It Works</h4>\n            <p class=\"mb-0\">The calculator’s FC cost model, pass handling, and rush-plan logic.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fm-methodology-wrap\">\n            <div class=\"row g-4\">\n              <div class=\"col-xl-7\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                  <div class=\"card-header bg-secondary text-white\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mb-0\">How the FC cost curve works</h5>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"card-body\">\n                    <p>\n                      Every barrier gets cheaper as you wait. The calculator models that drop with a\n                      power law:\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"formula\">fc(t) = c x t<sup>p</sup></div>\n                    <p>\n                      That gives a smooth estimate from the full timer down to the headpiece-reduced\n                      timer, which is enough to solve both standard skip paths and partial-wait rush\n                      scenarios.\n                    </p>\n                    <div id=\"methodologyChartContainer\">\n                      <canvas id=\"methodologyChart\"></canvas>\n                    </div>\n                    <details>\n                      <summary>How c and p are derived</summary>\n                      <p class=\"mt-2\">\n                        Using two known points <code>(t_before, fc_before)</code> and\n                        <code>(t_after, fc_after)</code>:\n                      </p>\n                      <div class=\"formula\">\n                        p = log(fc_before / fc_after) / log(t_before / t_after)\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"formula\">c = fc_after / t_after<sup>p</sup></div>\n                    </details>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"col-xl-5\">\n                <div class=\"card\">\n                  <div class=\"card-header bg-secondary text-white\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mb-0\">What the result includes</h5>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"card-body\">\n                    <ul class=\"mb-0\">\n                      <li>\n                        <strong>Furthest push:</strong> the last barrier you can clear sequentially\n                        with your current FC.\n                      </li>\n                      <li>\n                        <strong>Rush timing:</strong> the shortest wait needed before you can skip\n                        to the end.\n                      </li>\n                      <li>\n                        <strong>FC chart:</strong> your balance after each spend and reward step.\n                      </li>\n                      <li>\n                        <strong>Progression table:</strong> the exact cost and reward breakdown for\n                        every remaining barrier.\n                      </li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"card mt-3\">\n                  <div class=\"card-header bg-secondary text-white\">\n                    <h5 class=\"mb-0\">Assumptions</h5>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"card-body\">\n                    <ul class=\"mb-0\">\n                      <li><strong>Headpiece equipped:</strong> skip costs use FC Cost After.</li>\n                      <li>\n                        <strong>Pendrives equipped:</strong> reduced timer and cost values are\n                        already reflected.\n                      </li>\n                      <li>\n                        <strong>No time jumps:</strong> ad watches, events, and other timer skips\n                        are excluded.\n                      </li>\n                      <li>\n                        <strong>Edgar is a starting bonus:</strong> selected offers are added to\n                        your starting FC immediately.\n                      </li>\n                    </ul>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
          },
